# Aston Martin Vantage V8 coupe, 2018-2024.
#
# The 2018 Vantage: the wide low grille, the pronounced front splitter, the
# deep side scallop and the full-width rear light bar. The coupe is modelled;
# the Roadster is a different body.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aston_Martin_Vantage_(2018)
#
# Dimensions 4.465 x 1.943 x 1.272 m, wheelbase 2.705 m.
#
# Shape reference: a blue Korean-market Vantage in true side elevation, and a
# light blue UK car, plate KY19 KKN, in front and rear three-quarter. The
# side view is one car; the three-quarters another of the same model.
#
# Colours: grade (c), documented period cars. Blue, silver, black and red are
# the plain names used. Weights 3, 3, 2, 2, total 10, provisional.
#
# Speed 315 km/h. Comfort 88/462, on the line 330 + 1.5 x 88. Classes 3,4.
# Dates are road presence: 2018 intro, retires staggered 2043-2046.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/aston-vantage-2018.blend. Interchange:
# citycars/4.5/aston-vantage-2018.dae. References:
# citycars/references/aston-vantage-2018/ (gitignored; Wikimedia Commons).
#
# Accepted deviations: the grille opening is too angular, the outer ends of
# the rear light bar look broken, and the diffuser is too shallow. At 128 px
# the low roof, short deck and ducktail read as a 2018 Vantage.


obj=citycar
name=AstonVantage2018(Blue)
copyright=JamesPetts

DistributionWeight=3
intro_year=2018
intro_month=6
retire_year=2046
retire_month=6
speed=315
class=3,4
maximum_comfortable_journey_minutes=88
maximum_tolerable_journey_minutes=462

